    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d434">

                <pb facs="0693" n="579" xml:id="pg579"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">662.6331/86: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Austria</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stockton</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-06T17:00:00-05:00">April 6, 1931—5
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>19. Legation’s 30, April 4, 1 p.m. Are “interim duties” temporary duties which
                    will be imposed at the Austro-German border until the customs union is
                    completely organized? Do you know when they will go into effect or what they
                    will be?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Carr</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
